## SQ-PF16-01 | whistle goal skip and underground bees mixins
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -i -E "NeaWhistleGoalSkip|MobBeeIdle|Mixin.*(error|fail)" logs/latest.log`
@pass No mixin error; server reaches `Done`
@fails Name the mixin; SRG ids m_8036_ (TemptByWhistleGoal), m_6140_ (Mob)
@from batches/r1031/a1_boot.qb passed
bootreject (?i)(NeaWhistleGoalSkip|MobBeeIdle).*(error|fail)

## SQ-PF16-02 | whistling arrow still pulls animals
@group A
@commands Summon cows and sheep near the player, shoot a whistling arrow (`/give @p nock_enough_arrows:whistling_arrow`, bow) into the ground 6 to 10 blocks from them
@pass Mobs within 12 blocks walk to the arrow as before; after it is picked up or despawns they stop following
@fails Mobs ignore the arrow: tracker missed the join (check the entity class name)
@from batches/r1031/a2_variants.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
> time set noon
> summon minecraft:cow 6 -60 6
> summon minecraft:cow 7 -60 5
> summon minecraft:sheep 5 -60 7
> summon nock_enough_arrows:whistling_arrow 14 -60 14 {inGround:1b,pickup:0b}
> cdevtest tickwarp 300
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=300 60
> execute positioned 14 -60 14 if entity @e[type=#minecraft:animals_spawnable_on,distance=..4]
> execute positioned 14 -60 14 if entity @e[type=minecraft:cow,distance=..4]
> kill @e[type=nock_enough_arrows:whistling_arrow]
reject \[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=)
look cows and sheep walk to the arrow (second check passes); after the kill they stop following; a summoned arrow that never "joins" the tracker = the whistle needs a shot arrow (client CQ-PF16-02)
reject (?i)unknown entity

## SQ-PF16-03 | an underground bee hovers while no player is near
@group A
@commands `/tp` to y 20 in a cave; `/summon minecraft:bee ~ ~ ~5`; watch it 20 s; then `/tp @p ~ ~ ~100` for 30 s; `/execute as @e[type=bee,limit=1,sort=nearest] run data get entity @s Pos` twice 10 s apart; come back
@pass Near: flies about. Away: Pos unchanged between reads (hovers). Back within 32 blocks: flies again
@fails Moves while away: mixin did not apply. Falls or takes damage: check flying state
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-3, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1031 b1_gameplay / w2_metas_spawns bot row
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 120 0 minecraft:overworld creative
